<p id="_e977faed-8a1c-f562-2960-c415fbc93da5" semx-id="_e977faed-8a1c-f562-2960-c415fbc93da5">The session will be opened by the Director of the Economic Cooperation and Trade Division of the United Nations Economic Commission for Europe (UNECE).</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_e29c93e3-6d24-641d-279f-f03e94748c92" inline-header="false" obligation="normative" semx-id="_e29c93e3-6d24-641d-279f-f03e94748c92">
