<p id="_4a44f280-f94c-02e9-08a0-4acad25ec899" semx-id="_4a44f280-f94c-02e9-08a0-4acad25ec899">The Group will discuss its future work, including the specific activities to be undertaken during the coming year.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_e3e8577b-aca6-9232-e603-7821360adafd" inline-header="false" obligation="normative" semx-id="_e3e8577b-aca6-9232-e603-7821360adafd">
<title id="_bf39fbe3-1303-f2ed-5f07-7f14beb6918f" semx-id="_80e99f6a-6acc-6c8c-f594-de612a442604">Item 7. Other business</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_45e48a3d-fd99-0613-ce50-e5d010a261c3"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_bf39fbe3-1303-f2ed-5f07-7f14beb6918f">Item 7. Other business</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label>paragraph 8</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_d1a65f6c-ea88-21e5-77f8-91df7dc36744" semx-id="_d1a65f6c-ea88-21e5-77f8-91df7dc36744">Experts will be invited to raise other issues not previously addressed during the session.</p>
</clause>

